<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan Int'l Insurance net up 15 pct.</title>
<headline>Pakistan Int'l Insurance net up 15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>				 (million rupees)</p>
<p>    Profit from operations  70 vs 53</p>
<p>    Provision for taxation  25 vs 14</p>
<p>    Profit after tax	  45 vs 39</p>
<p>    Dividend		30 pct vs 30 pct per 10-rupee share</p>
<p>    Bonus issue	   20 pct vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE - The International General Insurance Company of Pakistan Ltd transferred 25 million rupees to general reserves vs 25 million. AGM on April 28. Book closure April 19-28.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
